    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im not looking for a hotline or anything. i mean i know they exist but they dont get it. it's just... i look at my mom and she's so exhausted. she's working two jobs just to keep us afloat and then she comes home and has to take care of me too. i feel like a parasite. like i'm just taking and taking and there's nothing left to give back.",
