      "content": "but it's not just feeling bad. it's the math of it all. if i wasn't here, she wouldn't be working those extra hours for my stuff, she wouldn't have to worry about me constantly. everything would just be... lighter. for her and for everyone. it feels like the only way to actually be helpful is to stop being a problem.",
